WEBVTT

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.080
Love?

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.380
Indeed!

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.720
Um, could you say that again?

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.760
Who are you in love with?

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.050
I told you already, Oshutoru!

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.940
This is <i>definitely</i> going to be a pain in the neck.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.270
W-Well, considering how late it's getting...

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.530
Absolutely.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.190
It's time for children to go to bed.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.210
Hold up a sec.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:42.290
Ain't love just wonderful?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.500
I wanna help her out.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.880
But Atui, you've never...

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.260
I'll say it once more.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.050
It's time for children to go to bed!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:31.270
I had a bad feeling when you called me out this late...

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.650
but I didn't expect this.

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:37.900
Hey, cheer up.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.160
It's a task from the big brother 
you respect so much.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.280
I'm honored to be of service, then!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.660
What's that sound?

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.670
Leave it to me.

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.800
I don't think we should get involved.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.760
It's only going to lead to trouble.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:07.430
B-But Anju-sama was nice enough to come by.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.680
Exactly!

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.350
I was nice enough to come by!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.690
Um, listen, Anju...

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:16.060
It's late.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.530
The whole palace will be in a panic if they find out you're gone.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.360
Fear not!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.450
I prepared a double!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:29.410
I wouldn't want to get yelled at 
just for taking a moment's leave.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.830
I'll go call Munechika-sama.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.580
She's not there.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:39.170
"You must train to be ready for the unexpected battle!" she said.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.470
Her eyebrows were even closer together than normal. Like this!

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.970
And with that, she left!

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.470
For a night battle exercise.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.560
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.060
By the way, Haku-san.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.350
Have you ever heard of the Noble Thieves?

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:54.980
Noble Thieves?

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:56.480
Yes.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.070
They steal money from the wicked rich

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:02.240
and give it to the commoners of the capital, supposedly.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.780
That's pretty nice of them.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.490
But if they only steal from 
bad guys, what's the problem?

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.500
Well, you see...

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.500
From what I've heard...

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.960
these so-called Noble Thieves...

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.010
It's the Noble Thieves!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.840
They're back!

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.130
Hide the children!

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.760
Lock up your valuables!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:30.680
Capture them! Capture them!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.060
For the sake of all the people,

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:43.530
I punish the corrupt who line their own pockets in the name of Heaven!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.280
Now, enjoy!{orig:}{Now, accept!}

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.530
Accept the rain of blessings!{orig:}{This rain of blessings!}

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.290
Hey!

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.130
I finally got her to sleep,
and now she's awake again!

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:07.050
You can throw this thing at me,
but how do you expect me to use it!?

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.180
Forget that, and pay me 
for the roof you damaged!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.310
Sister.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:21.400
There are still others who await your arrival.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.230
Let us be on our way.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:23.320
I see.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:28.150
A good woman is one who has
many people waiting for her.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.120
Perhaps so, Sister.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.030
It stinks!

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.200
That's the story.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.710
Well, they sure sound like a pain.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:40.960
You said it.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:46.300
We'll just have to put her to sleep.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.840
How 'bout we use this then?

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:53.930
A book?

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.180
What?

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.480
I'm not sleepy yet.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.850
Hey, Anju.

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:05.320
We'll tell you a story.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:07.900
A story, you say?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:13.160
This is the proper setting for storytelling.

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.160
I see.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.710
All righty, I'll be reading now.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.420
A long, long time ago,

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.120
{a young god who had not even a name yet...}there was a young god without a name...

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.170
In any case,

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:32.680
I won't allow them to spread chaos in the 
city right under my big brother's nose!

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.920
You won't allow it?

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:38.350
Why don't we go around and try to catch them?

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:41.770
Of course, to do that, we need to 
finish here as quickly as possible!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.570
Listen, Kiuru.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.740
Every job should be taken seriously.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.700
Once you do this for a while, you'll realize...

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.740
You just don't want to go, right?

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.700
And at last,

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.710
havin' won the power of the girl's love,

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.580
he embraced her tightly...

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.210
What happens next?

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:09.710
<i>Wait, this is a love story!</i>

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:13.340
<i>If she hears this, she'll have an even 
harder time getting to sleep!</i>

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:19.220
And then, seekin' the assurance
of one another's presence, they...

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.600
Atui-sama?

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:42.830
K...

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.170
Ki...

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.170
K-Ki...

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.380
What's wrong?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.090
What, just a kiss?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.340
What is this "kiss" you speak of?

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.590
Well, it's...

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.970
Um, well...

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.350
What is this "kiss" you speak of?

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.850
U-Um, y'see, it's...

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:09.730
A kiss is, simply put...

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:14.320
When you touch lips with someone else.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:16.030
Th-That's right.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.370
It's a way of showing your love.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.870
Why would you do such a thing?

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.370
Wh-Why?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.380
Why would you touch lips with someone else?

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.010
Well, um...

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.470
She's asleep.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:45.270
Nekone-sama is so cute!

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.230
I'm green with envy...

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:51.020
Look at those positively glowin' cheeks of hers!

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:53.780
She's such a child.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:57.280
Well, that's how kids are.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.300
Okay, I'll read this time.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:22.560
Once upon a time, there was a very lazy man.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.810
The man was not only lazy,

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:27.730
but he behaved very, very badly...

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.230
What about the story we were just reading?

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.710
Anju-sama, now, now...

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.730
Man, I'm beat.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.360
And sleepy.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.570
And cold.

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.570
I wanna go home.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:42.580
Perhaps it was karma, or divine punishment...

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:50.580
But he fell into a deep abyss.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:58.630
He frantically reached out with his hands, hoping to grab on to anything he could.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:01.830
And then, when he thought he was done for...

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:11.060
He finally grabbed on to something.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.610
I'm saved...

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:17.440
Wh-Wh-Wha—

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:19.110
What are...

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.910
What are you doing!?

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.410
Wh-What do I...

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.910
do!?

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:35.380
Yet he fell to the bottom of 
the abyss anyway, it is said.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.460
The end.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:46.560
Is that love?

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:50.980
I-It says so on the book, so I guess it is...

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:52.310
Then...

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.980
How can I make Oshutoru fall in love with me!?

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.950
I'm a bird in a cage.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:05.150
I can't even go outside.

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:08.620
You came here just fine...

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:12.620
The last time she came, she took my book.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:16.210
We went shoppin' together just a while back.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:22.180
And it was none other than Oshutoru 
who showed me just how big

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.790
and how fun the outside world is!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:31.230
Well, a gentleman like that...

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:34.520
Ain't hard to see how a princess might fall in love with him.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.270
Is there nothing we can do for her?

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.570
Oh, fine.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:52.250
Let's all have a strategy meeting!

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.590
To win a man's heart,

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:02.380
the one thing you gotta have is womanly charms!

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.430
How's this?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.270
Or <i>this</i>?

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.310
Or how about <i>this</i>?

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:17.770
Ain't this sexy?

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:25.950
I can use this to get Oshutoru to like me, right?

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:29.370
L-Like this?

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.370
Or maybe this?

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.910
Or this?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.460
Oh, right, um...

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:46.220
We're helping Anju out.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.470
Big Sister!

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:50.600
Wh-What is it?

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.140
You join in, too!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.140
This is fun!

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.480
Like this!

00:12:58.480 --> 00:12:59.650
Try it!

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.900
Neko-yan,

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:08.700
a real woman never backs down from a challenge.

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:12.700
And you're cute, so I'm sure you can pull it off.

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.290
R-Really?

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:17.670
D-Don't push yourself too hard, Nekone-sama...

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.590
Like this?

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.470
See, I knew it!

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:32.100
Perfect!

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.270
How cute!

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:39.060
I do envy your youth.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:41.190
But can you handle this next one?

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.610
I won't lose!

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.320
Sister, I've been waiting.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.110
Here you are.

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.740
I'm sorry, Ougi.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:11.640
I can't go back like this.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:14.430
Oh, well.

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.610
It's just not coming together.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:32.320
Surely you must have some good ideas.

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.370
Let's hear them.

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.540
M-Me?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.120
If you want to tell someone you love them,

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:44.000
maybe you should write a love letter?

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:50.590
So, how does one go about writing a love letter?

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:53.970
I-I've never actually written one...

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:55.640
But...

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.390
A picture maybe...

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.270
You're quite skilled.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:04.400
I didn't know you were artistic.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.690
Oh, um... Thank you.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:11.900
They say Heaven never 
grants a person two gifts.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.160
Guess that ain't true!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.200
Y-You're embarrassing me!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.410
Two men?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:22.420
How wonderful!

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:30.210
By the way, why aren't 
these men wearing clothes?

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.590
Th-They're wearing invisible clothes!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:36.550
Invisible clothes? How novel!

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:37.930
Draw some more!

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:38.720
With pleasure!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.020
Here I go!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:44.650
This is also excellent!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.860
How about this?

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:48.360
From behind?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.400
How about handcuffs?

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.360
Or blindfolded with a cloth?

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.580
Such passion!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:01.040
And then... And then...!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.040
Ruru-yan...

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.930
This is wonderful.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:19.680
The stench won't go away.

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:22.770
Why did this happen to me?

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:35.700
I'm confiscating this!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.950
This is going too far!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.240
Now I have no choice.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.300
Looks like I'll have to...

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:44.460
Wait.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.130
What is it?

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:54.880
I'm told you know little of the 
subtleties of the heart.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:57.300
M-Me?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.600
That's what he said.

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:04.510
Uh, what was his name, again?

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:06.980
Haku...

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:09.510
That's right! Haku!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.720
That's what the man named Haku said!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:13.500
Said!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:14.450
Said!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:14.980
Haku!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:15.530
Haku!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.090
Haku!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:22.590
Anyway, I can't believe 
he just fell out of nowhere.

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:26.100
Jeez. What's <i>her</i> problem?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.670
That must have been...

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:30.090
Yes, a Nugisomukami.{What the fuck is that}

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.630
It had to be!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:34.760
Today was just an awful day.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.680
Oh, excuse me.

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.870
No, excuse me.

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:11.500
A Nugisomukami...

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:17.200
That was <i>definitely</i> a Nugisomukami.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:33.260
Haku...

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.860
So, apparently I'm...

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:46.870
a monstrously strong woman who 
eats too much and has no friends.

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:48.950
Come again?

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.420
Um, where'd you hear that?

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.090
First I've heard of it.

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.000
Anju told me.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.380
She did, did she?

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:01.880
Wait! I never said you were 
monstrously strong or ate too much!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:07.640
So you <i>did</i> say the third one...

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:24.730
Seduction and a love letter, huh?

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:28.160
But knowing Oshutoru...

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:31.540
I don't know if that would work on him.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.420
Then what <i>should</i> I do?

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.310
Shall we put on a little play?

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:55.370
That's right.

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:58.820
We could say you were kidnapped.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.720
Just kidding!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:04.190
You're being stupid again!

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:06.530
It was a joke!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.970
That's it!

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:12.160
The man I love comes to save me?

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.750
An excellent idea!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:15.960
Indeed!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:21.710
Is there no one who will grant my wish?

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:22.870
Well?

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.120
Well?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.480
Love is a strange thing, ever in motion.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.480
I've heard your tale.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.350
Young maiden blessed not with fortuity in love,

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:40.480
I, Nosuri, the Noble Thief,

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:43.060
shall grant your wish!

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:45.700
Truly?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.740
A good woman

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.620
never goes back on her word!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.460
Splendid!

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:58.880
Just leave everything to me!

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.800
Hey, wait!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.220
I don't know who you are,

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.250
but I'll be relying on you!

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:10.930
Indeed!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.390
Leave it to me!

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:17.930
I didn't think she'd take it seriously.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:20.900
The baths here are quite nice, no?

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:25.790
It makes me wish I lived here.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.790
Farewell.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:34.790
W-Wait!

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.960
Haku, you know them?

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:39.740
Well, uh...

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:47.680
I'm sure your friends took her seriously.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:52.550
{Did I... screw up?}This is... my fault?
